# The repository root is the Docker build context (see utils/docker/build.sh).
# Keep VCS metadata, registry credentials, local environment files, CI and
# editor configuration, and local build and test output out of the build
# context. The image installs its own node_modules with npm ci.
**/.git
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/.env*
.github
.azure-pipelines
.devcontainer
.claude
**/node_modules
test-results
playwright-report
sessions
